25:["$","p",null,{"children":["Most services are declared as an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"array"}],", and each element carries an\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"instance_name"}],". That field is a routing key: it selects which store (or\nscheduler) serves a request. The instance name is not part of the storage\nkey, so two instance names pointing at ",["$","em",null,{"children":"different"}]," stores are fully isolated,\nand two pointing at the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"same"}]," store share every blob."]}]
