36:["$","p",null,{"children":["Adding ",["$","code",null,{"children":"client_ca_file"}]," turns that into mutual TLS (clients must present a\ncertificate signed by that CA) and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"client_crl_file"}]," lets you revoke one.\nThat's the closest thing Forge has to built-in client authentication, and\nit is a reasonable answer for a cache exposed beyond a trusted network."]}]
